    "Public holidays observed in JOHOR. These drive the RM350 holiday rate.",
    "",
    "\"verified\": false means the date is moon-sighting or lunar-calendar dependent",
    "and is my best estimate, not gazetted fact. Malaysia gazettes each year's",
    "holidays around Q3 of the year before - when Johor publishes theirs, check",
    "every unverified row and flip it to true. Nothing else in the code needs to",
    "change; the site picks this file up on restart.",
    "",
    "Removing a row drops it to the base/weekend rate. Adding a row (school",
    "holidays, a family event, a long weekend you want to charge more for) is",
    "just another {date, name} entry - it does not have to be a real holiday.",
    "",
    "Official source: https://www.johor.gov.my  and  https://www.jpa.gov.my"
  ],

